# CAP04, service A. A skeleton.
#
# One path. Not the mount, not a prefix: the exact credential path this service
# reads, and the single capability it needs to read it.
#
# Before you write it, answer: does an agent that renews a lease need any
# capability beyond reading the credential? Check what the sidecar actually
# calls, in the audit log, rather than guessing.

path "# ?" {
  capabilities = [# ?]
}
